## SQL Injection Prevention

| ❌ Don't | ✅ Do | Why |
|----------|-------|-----|
| String interpolation in SQL | Parameterized queries (`$1`, `{name:Type}`) | SQL injection |

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
const sql = `SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = '${userId}'`;

// ✅ GOOD — Postgres
const sql = `SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = $1`;
db.query(sql, [userId]);

// ✅ GOOD — ClickHouse
const sql = `SELECT * FROM events WHERE {col_0:Identifier} = {val_0:String}`;
client.query(sql, { col_0: filter.column, val_0: filter.value });
```

### ClickHouse Placeholder Types

| Placeholder | Use For |
|-------------|---------|
| `{name:Identifier}` | Column/table names |
| `{name:String}` | String values |
| `{name:Int32}` | Integer values |
| `{name:DateTime}` | Date/time values |
| `{name:Array(String)}` | Array values |

