## Common Pitfalls

### Type Narrowing

| ❌ Don't | ✅ Do |
|----------|-------|
| `const user = data as User` | `Schema.decodeUnknownSync(User)(data)` or type guard |

### Null Handling

| ❌ Don't | ✅ Do |
|----------|-------|
| `user!.name` | `user?.name ?? "Unknown"` |

### Array Index Access

With `noUncheckedIndexedAccess: true`, `items[0]` is `T | undefined`. Use `items[0] ?? "default"` or `.at(0)` with check.

### Promise Handling

| ❌ Don't | ✅ Do |
|----------|-------|
| `fetchData();` (floating) | `await fetchData()` or `void fetchData()` |

