## HTTP Client (@tanstack/react-query)

When an API has no maintained SDK, generate a thin client and types from its OpenAPI spec. Regenerate whenever the spec changes — CI should fail `pnpm typecheck` if clients drift. Types propagate through `@tanstack/react-query` queries/mutations.

