## Middleware Patterns

### Logging Middleware

```typescript
const LoggingMiddleware = HttpMiddleware.make((app) =>
  Effect.gen(function* () {
    const request = yield* HttpServerRequest.HttpServerRequest;
    const start = Date.now();
    yield* Effect.logInfo("Request started", { method: request.method, url: request.url });
    const response = yield* app;
    yield* Effect.logInfo("Request completed", { duration: Date.now() - start });
    return response;
  }),
);
```

### Authentication Middleware

Extract `Bearer` token from header → `verifyToken` → `Effect.provideService(CurrentUser, user)`. Fail with `UnauthorizedError` if missing.

